WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.660
Six laws.

2
00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:02.980
Six dates.

3
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.500
One syllabus that loves to

4
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.940
shuffle them.

5
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.470
Let us put them back in order.

6
00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:11.261
1773. The Regulating Act.

7
00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.541
The Governor of Bengal becomes

8
00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:16.241
Governor General, and a Supreme

9
00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:17.701
Court opens at Calcutta.

10
00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:20.061
No more private trade for

11
00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.191
Company servants.

12
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.550
1784. Pitt's India Act.

13
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:26.710
A Board of Control in London

14
00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.470
watches politics, while the

15
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.370
directors keep the trade.

16
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.430
Parliament's answer to a

17
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:32.990
troublesome Company:

18
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.930
appoint a supervisor, and keep

19
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:36.840
the Company.

20
00:00:37.723 --> 00:00:40.783
1813. The first Charter Act.

21
00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:43.543
The trade monopoly ends, except

22
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.923
for tea and China.

23
00:00:44.923 --> 00:00:47.363
One lakh rupees a year for

24
00:00:47.363 --> 00:00:48.163
education.

25
00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:51.826
1833. The Governor General of

26
00:00:51.826 --> 00:00:53.506
Bengal becomes Governor General

27
00:00:53.506 --> 00:00:54.466
of India.

28
00:00:54.466 --> 00:00:57.166
The Company stops trading and

29
00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:57.806
only governs.

30
00:00:57.806 --> 00:01:00.816
Tea, at last, is let go.

31
00:01:01.608 --> 00:01:04.708
1853. Senior civil posts open to

32
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:05.908
a competitive examination, plus

33
00:01:05.908 --> 00:01:08.768
a separate legislative council.

34
00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:11.128
Which is, you will notice, why

35
00:01:11.128 --> 00:01:12.718
you are reading this.

36
00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.220
1858. The Crown takes over from

37
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:16.860
the Company.

38
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.480
A Secretary of State in London,

39
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.300
a council of fifteen, and the

40
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.800
Governor General is now also

41
00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:24.710
Viceroy.

42
00:01:26.542 --> 00:01:28.402
For GS1, mind the trap.

43
00:01:28.402 --> 00:01:31.635
Governor General of India is

44
00:01:31.635 --> 00:01:32.962
1833, not 1773.

45
00:01:32.962 --> 00:01:36.362
The Board of Control is Pitt's

46
00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.232
Act.

47
00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:40.219
Six Acts, one thread.

48
00:01:40.219 --> 00:01:42.179
Each one held the Company a

49
00:01:42.179 --> 00:01:43.349
little closer.
